  "service": "cloudtrail",
  "status": "reproducible",
  "note": "cloudtrail.py:237-241 · :370-374 — 파티션을 cn-north-1 · us-gov-east-1 만 aws-cn · aws-us-gov 로 본다. cn-northwest-1 · us-gov-west-1 의 클래식 선택기(arn:aws-cn:s3 등)는 매칭 안 돼 취약. :277 · :410 고급 선택기는 resources.type 만 봐서 resources.ARN 으로 버킷 하나만 기록해도 양호.",
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "id": "cn-northwest-1",
      "role": "bug",
      "condition": "cn-northwest-1 trail, 클래식 선택기 WriteOnly · AWS::S3::Object arn:aws-cn:s3(전체 버킷)",
      "args": [],
      "raw": {
        "cn-northwest-1": {
          "cloudtrail": {
            "describe_trails": [
              {
                "Name": "cn",
                "S3BucketName": "trail-bucket",
                "IncludeGlobalServiceEvents": true,
                "IsMultiRegionTrail": true,
                "HomeRegion": "cn-northwest-1",
                "TrailARN": "arn:aws:cloudtrail:cn-northwest-1:111122223333:trail/cn",
                "LogFileValidationEnabled": true,
                "HasCustomEventSelectors": false,
                "HasInsightSelectors": false,
                "IsOrganizationTrail": false,
                "TagsList": {},
                "trail_status": {
                  "IsLogging": true,
                  "LatestDeliveryTime": "2026-11-01T00:00:00Z",
                  "StartLoggingTime": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z"
                },
                "EventSelectors": {
                  "TrailARN": "arn:aws:cloudtrail:cn-northwest-1:111122223333:trail/cn",
                  "EventSelectors": [
                    {
                      "ReadWriteType": "WriteOnly",
                      "IncludeManagementEvents": true,
                      "DataResources": [
                        {
                          "Type": "AWS::S3::Object",
                          "Values": [
                            "arn:aws-cn:s3"
                          ]
                        }
                      ],
                      "ExcludeManagementEventSources": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "InsightSelectors": {}
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "verdict": "Secure",
        "good": 1
      },
      "why": "중국(aws-cn) 파티션의 전체 버킷 ARN 이다 — 모든 S3 쓰기 이벤트를 기록한다"
